iron-mcp-ext-apps ports the examples of the MCP Apps SDK
(https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps) to Scala.

Each View's HTML and CSS, and the data and behaviour of each example, follow
the upstream example of the same name. Upstream's code is licensed under
Apache-2.0 (contributions from authors who have not relicensed remain MIT);
see https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps/blob/main/LICENSE.

